From: khan <khan@localhost>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 01:49:21 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 37/50] s10-terminal: amber phosphor look, S10 VT font,
 scanlines, faster keyboard, no stuck scroll mode

